WEBVTT

1
00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.240
<i>This is the world of the Beyonders.</i>

2
00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:41.710
<i>By drinking potions. humans are able to attain 
various powers of the Beyonders</i>

3
00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:45.120
<i>and ascend to divinity.</i>

4
00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:51.240
<i>The 22 Pathways begin with 
the weakest. Sequence 9.</i>

5
00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:53.760
<i>The lower the sequence number.</i>

6
00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:56.600
<i>the stronger the Beyonder's abilities.</i>

7
00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:59.440
<i>Strong Beyonders of the higher-level Sequences</i>

8
00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:03.420
<i>can wield powers strong enough to rival gods.</i>

9
00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:06.800
<i>This path of evolution is called</i>

10
00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:09.800
<i>the Path of the Divine.</i>

11
00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:23.540
Fifth Epoch. the Iron Age
September 9th. 1349

12
00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:26.040
TINGEN CITY   DOOMSDAY

13
00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:34.060
<i>The world is a falsehood.</i>

14
00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:37.580
<i>Chaos is constant and eternal.</i>

15
00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:41.000
<i>The Supreme Being bestows blessings</i>

16
00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:44.040
<i>through depravity.</i>

17
00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:47.600
<i>filth.</i>

18
00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:50.540
<i>and darkness.</i>

19
00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:57.160
<i>Faint struggles end in futility.</i>

20
00:01:58.140 --> 00:01:59.700
<i>never to awaken.</i>

21
00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:03.360
<i>Carrying the sin of blasphemy.</i>

22
00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:07.660
<i>the shepherd crawls with devotion.</i>

23
00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:12.260
<i>I shall offer you all of the sacrificial lambs.</i>

24
00:02:12.260 --> 00:02:14.360
<i>in order to welcome...</i>

25
00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:19.760
<i>your divine descent!</i>

26
00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:40.020
<i>It hurts.</i>

27
00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:58.020
Two Months Prior

28
00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:58.020
Fifth Epoch. the Iron Age
 June 28th. 1349

29
00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:58.020
<i>Where am I?</i>

30
00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:00.200
<i>A nightmare?</i>

31
00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:02.260
<i>A gun!</i>

32
00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:07.260
<i>It hurts!</i>

33
00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:10.620
<i>It's not a brain hemorrhage. is it?</i>

34
00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.300
<i>Or sudden death from fatigue?</i>

35
00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:17.460
Klein.

36
00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:18.760
Who's there?!

37
00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:21.500
Who is Klein?

38
00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:29.770
<i>This isn't me.</i>

39
00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:32.160
<i>"Klein"?</i>

40
00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:34.760
<i>I've...</i>

41
00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:37.440
<i>transmigrated?</i>

42
00:03:46.020 --> 00:03:47.340
Situation report.

43
00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:48.320
Yes. Captain.

44
00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:50.000
Two deceased.

45
00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:52.600
Welch and Naya.

46
00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:55.740
history graduates from Khoy University.

47
00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:59.520
Judging from the scene. it was suicide.

48
00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:03.120
but Black Divination was likely performed here.

49
00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:04.920
or perhaps a Beyonder was sacrificed.

50
00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:09.200
As a result. some kind of evil power 
has descended here.

51
00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:12.260
This individual is...?

52
00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.160
Klein Moretti.

53
00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:18.260
A classmate of the deceased.

54
00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:20.260
Both his parents are deceased.

55
00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:22.240
and he currently lives with his siblings.

56
00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:27.980
<i>Klein Moretti.
A citizen of Tingen City of Awwa County</i>

57
00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:29.740
<i>in the Loen Kingdom
of the Northern Continent.</i>

58
00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:31.660
<i>A fresh history graduate.</i>

59
00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:34.740
<i>Proficient in ancient Feysac and Hermes.</i>

60
00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:38.520
<i>May 29th. Welch came to see me.</i>

61
00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:41.740
<i>He claimed to have come across
an ancient notebook.</i>

62
00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:43.160
<i>June 20th.</i>

63
00:04:43.160 --> 00:04:45.660
<i>we deciphered the first page.</i>

64
00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:47.240
<i>My Goddess!</i>

65
00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:49.780
<i>This is a notebook from the Fourth Epoch!</i>

66
00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:51.900
<i>The writer hailed from...</i>

67
00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:55.120
The Antigonus Family.

68
00:04:55.740 --> 00:04:59.180
<i>June 21st. 22nd. 25th.</i>

69
00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:01.060
Antigonus.

70
00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:03.380
<i>The Black Emperor.</i>

71
00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:05.240
<i>The Tudor Empire.</i>

72
00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:08.160
<i>The summit of the Hornacis Mountain Range.</i>

73
00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:11.100
<i>June 26th.</i>

74
00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:14.100
<i>"Are all these strange things real?"</i>

75
00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.340
<i>It's now the 28th.</i>

76
00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:19.640
<i>Why is there no entry from the 27th?</i>

77
00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:26.580
<i>Hermes language?</i>

78
00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:29.700
<i>"Everyone will die.</i>

79
00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:31.920
<i>including me."</i>

80
00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:35.180
<i>Why would Klein write that?</i>

81
00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:36.960
<i>What did he encounter?</i>

82
00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:38.120
Brother?

83
00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:57.380
Melissa Moretti. Younger Sister of Klein
Tingen Technical School Student

84
00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:59.220
You stayed up all night reading again?

85
00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:01.100
What are you doing?

86
00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:04.620
I just woke up. I'm cleaning up a bit.

87
00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:07.420
You're acting secretive.

88
00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:10.290
What was that?

89
00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:16.550
This... seems to be...

90
00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:18.720
broken again.

91
00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:25.540
<i>What's with that look of 
disparagement and resignation?</i>

92
00:06:27.140 --> 00:06:29.780
<i>Doesn't pulling the button up adjust the time?</i>

93
00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:37.160
It's okay now.

94
00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:40.400
<i>What </i>is<i> that expression?</i>

95
00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.460
<i>The look of someone caring 
for her idiot brother?</i>

96
00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:48.480
<i>The wound's almost healed up.</i>

97
00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:50.220
<i>A healing effect from transmigrating?</i>

98
00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:54.780
<i>A gunshot right through the temple?</i>

99
00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:56.360
<i>Was it suicide?</i>

100
00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:58.080
<i>Or was it disguised as suicide?</i>

101
00:06:58.780 --> 00:07:00.980
<i>Although Klein's remaining 
memories are scattered</i>

102
00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:03.160
<i>and many important details are missing.</i>

103
00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:05.400
<i>I can be certain</i>

104
00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:08.160
<i>that whatever is happening has 
to do with that ancient notebook.</i>

105
00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:11.580
<i>Then... what about my transmigration?</i>

106
00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:15.240
<i>Everything had been normal lately.</i>

107
00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:19.060
<i>I had just been down on my luck 
with work. That's all.</i>

108
00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:21.060
<i>Wait. that's right!</i>

109
00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.980
<i>I did a luck enhancement ritual 
just before dinner!</i>

110
00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:28.100
<i>Klein.</i>

111
00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:34.000
Go back to bed if you're still feeling out of it.

112
00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:35.820
I'm all right.

113
00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:38.420
All right. then. I'm off to school.

114
00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:41.840
Remember to buy eight pounds of fresh bread.

115
00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:43.840
It spoils quickly in this heat.

116
00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:49.960
Oh. and buy some mutton and peas. too.

117
00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.680
You've been working hard on your job search.

118
00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:54.680
I'll make you mutton stewed with peas.

119
00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:58.000
I'll be coming home a bit late today.

120
00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:59.100
Wait for me. okay?

121
00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:08.040
I'm sorry. Melissa.

122
00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:10.260
I might not be here when you get back.

123
00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:16.430
<i>A revolver is nowhere near quiet.</i>

124
00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:19.280
<i>and yet Melissa didn't notice 
a thing from the next room.</i>

125
00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:23.240
<i>The longer I stay here. 
the more dangerous it becomes.</i>

126
00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:25.860
<i>I'd best try that luck enhancement ritual again.</i>

127
00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:27.640
<i>Maybe I'll be able to transmigrate back.</i>

128
00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:32.280
<i>I hope I'll get to eat dinner at home today.</i>

129
00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:38.220
Mrs. Smyrin. eight pounds of rye bread.

130
00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:42.120
Klein. you've graduated now. haven't you?

131
00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:44.080
All thanks to your well wishes. Mrs. Smyrin.

132
00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.220
What an fine young lad you are.

133
00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:50.760
I'm sure you'll be able to make good money 
and move into a new place in no time.

134
00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:53.820
You and your siblings shouldn't have 
to live in an apartment like that.

135
00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:59.000
You should at least have your own... bathroom.

136
00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:02.520
Mrs. Smyrin.

137
00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:05.360
you sure sound like a young. energetic lady today.

138
00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:09.460
Goodbye. Mrs. Smyrin.

139
00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:11.560
Goodbye. young Klein.

140
00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:30.020
Iron Cross Street
Tingen City. Loen Kingdom

141
00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:36.660
<i>The sun looks about the same.</i>

142
00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:39.580
<i>If not for the eerie crimson moon.</i>

143
00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:41.960
<i>this would be just like a parallel Earth.</i>

144
00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:52.920
Threes.

145
00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:55.040
Tens!

146
00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:56.880
Jacks.

147
00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.020
Pass.

148
00:09:58.020 --> 00:09:59.560
Fighting the Landlord?

149
00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:02.840
<i>Oh. that's right. 
That game exists in this world. too.</i>

150
00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:04.500
<i>I think it was...</i>

151
00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.140
<i>about 100 years ago when the Intis Emperor.</i>

152
00:10:07.140 --> 00:10:08.900
Roselle Poetry Collection

153
00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:10.360
<i>Roselle Gustav. invented it.</i>

154
00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:14.300
<i>He also invented tarot divination 
and the steam engine.</i>

155
00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:18.280
<i>as well as improving the sailing boat 
and promoting the Spring Festival tradition.</i>

156
00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:21.320
<i>If we followed novel logic.</i>

157
00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:22.780
<i>then could Emperor Roselle Gustav...</i>

158
00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:25.220
<i>have been a transmigrator?</i>

159
00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:27.320
<i>Maybe even a fellow countryman?</i>

160
00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:38.320
<i>A circus performance?</i>

161
00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.220
Sir. tonight at seven o'clock!

162
00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:44.080
We await your presence.

163
00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:50.720
Praise the Goddess.

164
00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:28.140
Lost sheep.

165
00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:29.640
come forth.

166
00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:32.560
Accept this guidance for your path ahead.

167
00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:40.800
Regence

168
00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:49.770
<i>Where did he go?</i>

169
00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:53.880
Destiny is profound. its path unpredictable.

170
00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:56.110
Tarot can help you...

171
00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:58.180
peek into its mysteries.

172
00:11:58.180 --> 00:11:59.580
Tarot?

173
00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:01.960
Those are just like the tarot cards on Earth.

174
00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:04.820
Emperor Roselle really was a transmigrator. then?

175
00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:07.440
You're the first person to seek divination today.

176
00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:08.640
It's on the house.

177
00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:10.480
Have a seat.

178
00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:13.700
It's free?

179
00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:14.800
Indeed.

180
00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:16.610
Now. let's begin.

181
00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:17.460
Wait.

182
00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:19.620
Let me ask one more thing.

183
00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:22.460
What about interpreting 
the cards. then? Also free?

184
00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:26.020
Th-That's... also free.

185
00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:30.060
<i>They say there's nothing more 
expensive than something free.</i>

186
00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:36.460
What would you like to read?

187
00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:37.820
Past.

188
00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:39.140
present.

189
00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:40.640
and future.

190
00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:43.560
Please shuffle the cards

191
00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:45.440
and focus your mind on that which you seek.

192
00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:46.620
I've already done so.

193
00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:48.620
Please start.

194
00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:58.140
This represents your past.

195
00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:00.740
This. your present.

196
00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:03.340
And this. your future.

197
00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:06.340
All right. Mr. Free.

198
00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:09.260
Which card do you want to see first?

199
00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:12.260
The present.

200
00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:25.380
The Fool.

201
00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:34.820
<i>The Fool?</i>

202
00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:37.180
<i>The "0" card of the tarot?</i>

203
00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:40.340
<i>A fresh beginning with 
all kinds of possibilities?</i>

204
00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:40.340
Hey!

205
00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:42.880
Why are you impersonating me again?!

206
00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:45.420
You're just an animal trainer. 
and don't you forget it!

207
00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:47.820
<i>Well. then.</i>

208
00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:50.620
<i>Is an animal trainer who doesn't want 
to be a fortune-teller a bad clown?</i>

209
00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:53.160
Go check on your baboons.
Don't let me catch you again!

210
00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:57.260
Sir. my divination and interpretation 
has been quite accurate...

211
00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:23.180
The Seven Orthodox Gods of the North Continent
The Eternal Blazing Sun. the Lord of Storms.
the God of Wisdom and Knowledge.
the Evernight Goddess. the Earth Mother.
the God of Combat. and the God of Steam
and Machinery are the seven orthodox gods
recognized by the various countries across the
North Continent during the Fifth Epoch.
Their forms are not known.
and they are represented only by symbols.

212
00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:32.340
The Celestial Worthy of Heaven and Earth

213
00:14:32.340 --> 00:14:35.920
<i>Be this a luck enhancement ritual 
or a transmigration ritual...</i>

214
00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:38.380
<i>Please. just send me home.</i>

215
00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:42.780
<i>Place the four portions of staple food 
in the four corners of the room.</i>

216
00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:45.200
<i>Stand in the center of the room.</i>

217
00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:47.760
<i>Take four steps counter-clockwise 
in the shape of a square.</i>

218
00:14:56.140 --> 00:14:58.520
The Immortal Lord of Heaven and Earth for Blessings.

219
00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:03.520
The Sky Lord of Heaven and Earth for Blessings.

220
00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:09.040
The Exalted Thearch of Heaven and Earth for Blessings.

221
00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:18.720
The Celestial Worthy of Heaven and Earth for Blessings!

222
00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:22.500
Awwa County Police

223
00:15:35.860 --> 00:15:37.080
<i>Nothing happened?</i>

224
00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:38.930
<i>That can't be right.</i>

225
00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:40.680
<i>Just now. it—</i>

226
00:15:45.780 --> 00:15:49.180
<i>You wouldn't die if you didn't court death.</i>

227
00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:54.820
The Celestial Worthy of Heaven and Earth

228
00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:29.360
<i>What... is this place?</i>

229
00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:39.980
Mirror. mirror...

230
00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:41.760
In the name of the Hall family.

231
00:16:41.760 --> 00:16:44.340
I command you... to awaken!

232
00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:49.000
Sir...

233
00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.530
If I may ask... Where is this?

234
00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:53.040
<i>Did I...</i>

235
00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:54.940
<i>summon these two?</i>

236
00:17:58.540 --> 00:17:59.880
If I may ask...

237
00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:02.180
Might you be the master of this Divine Realm?

238
00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:04.360
<i>"Divine Realm"?</i>

239
00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:08.760
<i>A place without so much as a shrine. 
and you call it a Divine Realm?</i>

240
00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:32.120
<i>Is this what people call "the law 
follows the word"? Materialization?</i>

241
00:18:32.680 --> 00:18:34.620
<i>Could it be that this gray fog...</i>

242
00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:38.480
<i>is something like a third-party tool for my use?</i>

243
00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:46.550
<i>It is!</i>

244
00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:47.620
Sir.

245
00:18:48.300 --> 00:18:49.350
If I may ask...

246
00:18:50.360 --> 00:18:51.620
What is this place?

247
00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:54.300
And who are you?

248
00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:55.880
<i>Me?</i>

249
00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:04.520
<i>Am I Zhou Mingrui?</i>

250
00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:05.720
<i>Or am I Klein?</i>

251
00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:23.940
You may address me as...

252
00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:30.820
The Fool.

253
00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:34.310
The Fool?

254
00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:36.730
Mr. Fool.

255
00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:39.340
what is it that you are doing?

256
00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:41.660
A test run.

257
00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:43.360
A test run?

258
00:19:46.820 --> 00:19:49.840
Mr. Fool. is the test over?

259
00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:51.880
Might you permit our return?

260
00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:53.820
Certainly.

261
00:19:54.220 --> 00:19:56.240
If you make a formal request.

262
00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:58.720
you can return this very moment.

263
00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:02.680
<i>From her voice. she seems 
to be an innocent young girl.</i>

264
00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:04.760
<i>As for the other.</i>

265
00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:07.240
<i>he sounds calm and cautious—</i>

266
00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:09.620
<i>difficult to get a grasp on.</i>

267
00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:12.360
This is such a wonderful experience.

268
00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:16.820
I've always hoped for something 
mysterious and supernatural to occur.

269
00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:20.240
Mr. Fool. what can I do to become a Beyonder?

270
00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:21.860
<i>A Beyonder?</i>

271
00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:23.480
<i>I've never even heard of such a thing.</i>

272
00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:31.720
This gentleman here should be able 
to answer your question.

273
00:20:34.060 --> 00:20:36.980
<i>The lady across from me has the 
manner of speech of a Loen noble.</i>

274
00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:38.840
<i>while I'm far away. by the Sonia Sea.</i>

275
00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:40.820
<i>Between us lies a great distance.</i>

276
00:20:40.820 --> 00:20:42.840
<i>How did The Fool manifest this?</i>

277
00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:47.100
You are from Loen. correct?

278
00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:50.360
To become a Beyonder. join the 
organization of the Evernight Goddess.

279
00:20:50.360 --> 00:20:53.120
the Lord of Storms. or some other.

280
00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:57.200
Though the majority of us will not meet 
a Beyonder once in our entire lives.

281
00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:59.260
it is indisputable that they exist.

282
00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:02.920
<i>Even now. they fight against 
the dangers that grow in the dark.</i>

283
00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:05.700
<i>But... I don't want to lose my freedom.</i>

284
00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:08.340
Then you can only seek the royal families

285
00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:10.260
or the noble families over a millennium old.

286
00:21:11.260 --> 00:21:12.960
Are there no other options?

287
00:21:16.780 --> 00:21:18.060
I do have...

288
00:21:18.580 --> 00:21:20.820
two sets of Sequence 9 potion formulas.

289
00:21:21.220 --> 00:21:23.420
<i>"Sequence 9"?</i>

290
00:21:21.220 --> 00:21:23.420
<i>Really? Which two sets?</i>

291
00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:27.200
One is named "Sailor." 
and the other is "Spectator."

292
00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:28.780
You'll have acute powers of observation.

293
00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:32.540
and will be able to judge "actors" 
in the secular world.

294
00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:32.540
<i>It seems they're referring to various 
kinds of superhuman powers.</i>

295
00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:34.520
<i>"Sequence 9" sounds like a power level.</i>

296
00:21:35.340 --> 00:21:38.520
I think I have fallen in love with 
this feeling of being a "Spectator"...

297
00:21:35.340 --> 00:21:38.520
<i>This gray fog and my transmigration...</i>

298
00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:41.740
<i>Are they also some Beyonder power?</i>

299
00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:46.000
Mr. Fool. I have successfully reached 
a trade agreement with this gentleman.

300
00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:48.740
Please allow me to make a presumptuous request.

301
00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:51.460
Could you bear witness to our trade?

302
00:21:51.720 --> 00:21:53.420
It's no trouble at all.

303
00:21:54.340 --> 00:21:56.820
Then would you mind arranging 
a few more gatherings like this?

304
00:21:56.820 --> 00:21:58.080
<i>Gatherings?</i>

305
00:21:58.500 --> 00:21:59.720
Mr. Fool.

306
00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:03.260
Your powers far exceed our imaginations.

307
00:22:03.260 --> 00:22:05.780
But the lady of lofty stature and myself

308
00:22:05.780 --> 00:22:09.240
may be able to help you 
achieve something trivial

309
00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:12.260
that had previously inconvenienced you.

310
00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:16.430
<i>With more frequent gatherings 
comes the risk of exposing myself.</i>

311
00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:18.740
<i>But the more contact I have 
with this mysterious realm.</i>

312
00:22:18.740 --> 00:22:20.990
<i>the better my chances are 
of finding a way home.</i>

313
00:22:22.100 --> 00:22:24.640
<i>I must overcome this fear of the unknown.</i>

314
00:22:25.660 --> 00:22:30.160
Then let us meet every Monday 
at three in the afternoon.

315
00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:31.740
Try your best to be alone.

316
00:22:32.420 --> 00:22:33.460
You may continue.

317
00:22:36.100 --> 00:22:38.760
Shall we give ourselves code names. then?

318
00:22:38.760 --> 00:22:40.880
After all. we can't use our 
real names for conversation.

319
00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:42.500
Good idea.

320
00:22:48.140 --> 00:22:50.980
Since Mr. Fool's name is derived 
from the tarot...

321
00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:56.500
I know! I shall be Justice!

322
00:22:55.380 --> 00:22:56.500
Audrey Hall
Justice. Tarot Club

323
00:22:58.690 --> 00:23:00.220
The Hanged Man.

324
00:22:58.980 --> 00:23:00.220
Alger Wilson
The Hanged Man. Tarot Club

325
00:23:00.700 --> 00:23:04.220
Then that makes us the founding 
members of the Tarot Club!

326
00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:04.220
<i>I'm losing strength...</i>

327
00:23:05.180 --> 00:23:06.680
I heard that initially.

328
00:23:06.680 --> 00:23:09.800
Emperor Roselle made a 
different deck of tarot cards.

329
00:23:09.800 --> 00:23:11.000
Yes.

330
00:23:11.000 --> 00:23:14.060
It is said that Emperor Roselle 
had seen the Blasphemy Slate

331
00:23:14.060 --> 00:23:18.040
which contains the profound mysteries 
of the 22 Paths of the Divine.

332
00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:19.060
Enough.

333
00:23:21.980 --> 00:23:24.200
Today's gathering ends here.

334
00:23:24.820 --> 00:23:26.400
By your will.

335
00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:30.760
By your will.

336
00:23:47.580 --> 00:23:48.780
Who is it?

337
00:23:49.100 --> 00:23:50.280
The police.

338
00:23:54.100 --> 00:23:54.940
Coming.

339
00:24:03.460 --> 00:24:04.840
<i>An inspector?</i>

340
00:24:07.700 --> 00:24:09.760
Apologies. I was just having a nap.

341
00:24:10.700 --> 00:24:11.600
We meet again.

342
00:24:11.600 --> 00:24:15.100
You're the guy... who was 
following me in the town square.

343
00:24:15.100 --> 00:24:16.630
"Following" you?

344
00:24:15.780 --> 00:24:20.620
Leonard Mitchell
Loen Kingdom. Awwa County Police

345
00:24:16.630 --> 00:24:18.340
An interesting choice of words.

346
00:24:18.340 --> 00:24:20.620
Why can't I have been "protecting" you?

347
00:24:21.500 --> 00:24:24.860
Leonard Mitchell. Awwa County Police.

348
00:24:24.860 --> 00:24:26.020
You're entering without—

349
00:24:26.020 --> 00:24:28.440
Relax. Mr. Moretti.

350
00:24:32.060 --> 00:24:33.930
We just want to ask you a few questions.

351
00:24:33.220 --> 00:24:35.220
Dunn Smith
Loen Kingdom. Awwa County Police

352
00:24:40.540 --> 00:24:41.380
Inspectors...

353
00:24:42.180 --> 00:24:44.200
Did Naya and Welch really...

354
00:24:44.740 --> 00:24:46.260
take their own lives?

355
00:24:46.260 --> 00:24:49.020
Judging from the scene. yes.

356
00:24:49.860 --> 00:24:51.560
<i>You call that suicide?</i>

357
00:24:51.560 --> 00:24:53.280
<i>They looked possessed!</i>

358
00:24:53.280 --> 00:24:55.620
What "strange things"?

359
00:24:55.620 --> 00:24:56.260
You...

360
00:24:57.060 --> 00:24:58.220
And this here...

361
00:24:59.100 --> 00:25:02.120
"Everyone will die. including me."

362
00:25:02.120 --> 00:25:03.740
What did you mean by that?

363
00:25:12.420 --> 00:25:13.260
I have no idea.

364
00:25:13.820 --> 00:25:15.460
I really can't remember.

365
00:25:16.000 --> 00:25:17.760
Especially recent events.

366
00:25:18.260 --> 00:25:20.280
Evidence indicates that on the 27th.

367
00:25:20.280 --> 00:25:22.620
you visited Mr. McGovern's residence.

368
00:25:22.620 --> 00:25:24.160
So I did go there?

369
00:25:25.260 --> 00:25:27.320
You might not believe what I'm saying.

370
00:25:27.320 --> 00:25:30.120
but I can only guess at recent events 
through reading my diary.

371
00:25:31.260 --> 00:25:34.320
Mr. McGovern has lost a revolver.

372
00:25:35.460 --> 00:25:38.700
I'd wager I should be able to find it here.

373
00:25:38.700 --> 00:25:40.440
Isn't that right. Mr. Moretti?

374
00:25:40.440 --> 00:25:42.380
It's in the stove over there.

375
00:25:43.180 --> 00:25:45.080
Do you have anything you wish to add?

376
00:25:45.080 --> 00:25:45.930
Yes.

377
00:25:46.460 --> 00:25:50.740
Yesterday. I awoke in the middle of the night 
and found myself collapsed over the desk.

378
00:25:51.180 --> 00:25:54.300
as if I had gone through a failed suicide attempt.

379
00:25:54.300 --> 00:25:55.680
After that.

380
00:25:55.680 --> 00:25:57.400
I started to lose some memories.

381
00:25:57.400 --> 00:25:59.080
Your mental fortitude is impressive.

382
00:25:59.080 --> 00:26:01.170
You can tell from my voice I'm not lying. right?

383
00:26:01.860 --> 00:26:04.320
That does fit what I've surmised so far.

384
00:26:04.860 --> 00:26:05.660
However.

385
00:26:06.400 --> 00:26:07.880
what I think is irrelevant.

386
00:26:08.380 --> 00:26:11.460
You will have to pass a psychic test 
administered by an expert.

387
00:26:11.460 --> 00:26:12.460
She...

388
00:26:13.100 --> 00:26:16.180
should be able to help you 
recall your lost memories.

389
00:26:16.180 --> 00:26:17.920
<i>A psychic expert?</i>

390
00:26:17.920 --> 00:26:20.000
<i>What if my memories of Earth are exposed?</i>

391
00:26:20.000 --> 00:26:21.440
You're a lucky one.

392
00:26:22.780 --> 00:26:25.620
Frankly. we're relieved 
to see you're still alive.

393
00:26:25.620 --> 00:26:29.340
Usually. when we investigate a case like this one.

394
00:26:29.340 --> 00:26:31.360
all involved parties...

395
00:26:31.360 --> 00:26:32.680
are found dead.

396
00:26:51.330 --> 00:26:53.780
What's wrong. Mr. Moretti?

397
00:26:54.940 --> 00:26:57.220
<i>If they find out that I'm a transmigrator...</i>

398
00:26:57.220 --> 00:26:58.700
Stop right there!

399
00:26:58.700 --> 00:26:59.780
Damn it!

400
00:26:59.780 --> 00:27:02.600
You rascal! You steal from me every day!

401
00:27:03.500 --> 00:27:04.820
Stop right there!

402
00:27:04.820 --> 00:27:05.940
Stop him!

403
00:27:07.860 --> 00:27:08.620
Lemme go!

404
00:27:10.460 --> 00:27:12.080
I've finally caught you.

405
00:27:12.080 --> 00:27:14.000
Just have him return what he stole.

406
00:27:14.000 --> 00:27:16.740
Let go of me. or I'll curse you!

407
00:27:20.060 --> 00:27:21.060
<i>This is my chance!</i>

408
00:27:21.060 --> 00:27:22.160
Let go!

409
00:27:54.940 --> 00:27:57.020
<i>Time and space are frozen?</i>

410
00:28:02.180 --> 00:28:03.500
<i>It's a Beyonder!</i>

411
00:28:32.820 --> 00:28:34.330
To the pier outside the city.

412
00:28:35.140 --> 00:28:36.020
You got it.

413
00:28:45.540 --> 00:28:48.360
<i>No one is coming after me 
and there are no abnormalities.</i>

414
00:28:48.360 --> 00:28:49.940
Please pull over.

415
00:28:55.300 --> 00:28:56.500
Where are you going?

416
00:28:56.500 --> 00:28:58.380
To Welch's residence.

417
00:29:09.620 --> 00:29:11.380
<i>It was a dream?</i>

418
00:29:11.380 --> 00:29:12.700
<i>When did I fall asleep?</i>

419
00:29:28.780 --> 00:29:30.500
Allow me to reintroduce myself.

420
00:29:30.180 --> 00:29:32.060
Dunn Smith
Evernight Goddess. Nighthawk

421
00:29:31.040 --> 00:29:32.060
Nighthawk.

422
00:29:32.660 --> 00:29:34.540
Dunn Smith.

423
00:29:36.020 --> 00:29:39.160
<i>Was he the one manipulating my dream?</i>

424
00:29:39.620 --> 00:29:41.200
<i>Is he a Beyonder?</i>

425
00:29:41.860 --> 00:29:43.240
Mr. Moretti.

426
00:29:43.660 --> 00:29:45.340
In the dark of the night.

427
00:29:45.340 --> 00:29:48.180
we are far more powerful than you can imagine.

428
00:29:48.180 --> 00:29:49.520
"We"?

429
00:29:59.220 --> 00:30:00.720
No need to be nervous.

430
00:30:01.620 --> 00:30:04.360
I'll make you all slick and pliable.

431
00:30:05.060 --> 00:30:07.280
so that you can open right up.

432
00:30:07.280 --> 00:30:08.900
Don't...

433
00:30:08.900 --> 00:30:10.160
Don't worry.

434
00:30:10.540 --> 00:30:12.780
This is her idea of calming you down.

435
00:30:12.780 --> 00:30:16.440
She prefers corpses over men.

436
00:30:36.740 --> 00:30:39.140
Mom! Dad!

437
00:30:39.140 --> 00:30:40.180
Klein.

438
00:30:43.740 --> 00:30:46.160
Memories on the surface can be wiped away.

439
00:30:46.660 --> 00:30:51.800
but in the vast ocean of the mind. there are 
always shadows left drifting in the deep.

440
00:30:51.800 --> 00:30:53.080
<i>Did she see that?</i>

441
00:30:53.660 --> 00:30:56.060
<i>No. she doesn't know yet.</i>

442
00:30:56.610 --> 00:31:00.060
<i>Judging by her words. this is my mind.</i>

443
00:31:00.060 --> 00:31:02.180
<i>and yet she can't see through to my secrets.</i>

444
00:31:02.560 --> 00:31:05.440
<i>Could it be because of that gray fog?</i>

445
00:31:06.360 --> 00:31:07.180
Klein.

446
00:31:08.080 --> 00:31:09.040
Tell me.

447
00:31:09.580 --> 00:31:13.820
What did you do with the notebook 
of the Antigonus Family?

448
00:31:13.820 --> 00:31:15.480
<i>The notebook is gone?</i>

449
00:31:16.400 --> 00:31:17.790
I don't know.

450
00:31:17.790 --> 00:31:20.460
On June 27th.

451
00:31:20.460 --> 00:31:23.140
what happened in Welch's home?

452
00:31:23.670 --> 00:31:24.920
Welch...

453
00:31:25.460 --> 00:31:26.620
Naya...

454
00:31:27.540 --> 00:31:28.940
I don't know.

455
00:31:28.940 --> 00:31:31.300
When they died.

456
00:31:31.780 --> 00:31:34.380
what were you doing?

457
00:31:35.520 --> 00:31:36.860
<i>I...</i>

458
00:31:56.020 --> 00:31:57.960
<i>I've... passed the test?</i>

459
00:31:57.960 --> 00:32:00.160
I can confirm three things.

460
00:32:00.160 --> 00:32:01.700
He attempted suicide via gunshot.

461
00:32:01.700 --> 00:32:03.300
but it's clear that he still lives.

462
00:32:03.820 --> 00:32:06.240
As for his lost memories.

463
00:32:06.240 --> 00:32:08.720
they are just like Welch and Naya's souls:

464
00:32:08.720 --> 00:32:10.020
no trace remains.

465
00:32:11.820 --> 00:32:14.920
I fear whatever power was able to affect him so.

466
00:32:13.620 --> 00:32:16.500
Daly Simone
Evernight Goddess.
 Nighthawk

467
00:32:14.920 --> 00:32:17.960
I've never encountered something so troublesome.

468
00:32:21.620 --> 00:32:23.700
You need to be careful.

469
00:32:26.140 --> 00:32:28.500
The Antigonus Family's notebook is missing.

470
00:32:29.220 --> 00:32:31.000
The threat to your life still remains.

471
00:32:33.140 --> 00:32:33.970
Then I—

472
00:32:33.970 --> 00:32:35.380
We're not your babysitters.

473
00:32:36.100 --> 00:32:37.800
We can't always protect you.

474
00:32:40.180 --> 00:32:41.300
Or...

475
00:32:42.300 --> 00:32:45.620
Perhaps you'd like to join us and become...

476
00:32:45.620 --> 00:32:47.520
a Beyonder?
